    "md5": "915b6aac1965817eb1e22961748c4370",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1958,
    "chunk_text": "GoodWe concludes successful participation at Power & Energy Expo Sri Lanka 2026\n\nGoodWe, a global leader leader in inverter and energy storage solutions, successfully concluded its participation at Power & Energy Expo Sri Lanka 2026 in partnership with its trusted distributor, Brantel Lanka.\n\nHeld amid Sri Lanka\u2019s accelerating transition to renewable energy and grid modernization, the expo brought together key industry stakeholders from across the region. GoodWe showcased its latest residential hybrid solar, energy storage, and smart energy management solutions, reinforcing its commitment to advancing clean energy adoption.\n\nFor the residential segment, the company showcased its ET LV hybrid inverter with the Lynx A G4 battery system and the ES Uniq hybrid inverter with the Lynx U G3 battery system. Designed for high efficiency, reliable backup, and smart energy management, the solutions attracted strong interest for their compact design, easy installation, and intelligent monitoring capabilities.\n\nThroughout the event, GoodWe\u2019s booth attracted strong interest from industry professionals, project developers, and prospective partners eager to explore solutions for Sri Lanka\u2019s evolving energy landscape. The company engaged in productive discussions on partnership opportunities, product deployment strategies, and the broader policy direction shaping the nation\u2019s clean energy transition.\n\nGoodWe extend its gratitude to the organizers, partners, and visitors who made the event a success, and remains committed to supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s journey toward a resilient, low-carbon energy future.\n\nGoodWe is a world-leading PV inverter and energy storage systems manufacturer listed on the Shanghai Stock Exchange (Stock Code: 688390). The company has more than 6000 employees located in 15 different countries and a team of over 1000 engineers working at its R&D centers to continuously optimize and advance energy storage technology."
