    "description": "Govt. launches \u2018Ceylon Tea Village\u2019 program to drive $ 2.5 b export target by 2030",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Govt-launches-Ceylon-Tea-Village-program-to-drive-2-5-b-export-target-by-2030/34-794721",
