    "md5": "03b7357121fe1d0841e13179457e621c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1576,
    "chunk_text": "Home Lands creates real estate history with over 5,000 units sold\n\nNalin Herath, Chairman, Home Lands Group, and Angelo Desmond, Home Lands\u2019 5,000th customer, cutting the celebratory cake in the presence of Harshani Herath, Director, Home Lands Group; Tharushinee Liyanage; Avanthi Caldera, Home Lands\u2019 first customer; Saranga Boralesgamuwa; and Lanka Jayasinghe, Director - Operations & Administration, Home Lands Group\n\nHome Lands Group has created real estate history once again, by crossing the 5,000 unit milestone in sales.\n\nHaving sold over 5,000 Resort Apartments and Villas across multiple mega lifestyle development projects, Home Lands continues to lead and define the real estate landscape in Sri Lanka.\n\nIn addition to selling over 5,000 units, the company has also delivered over 3,750 units to home owners who placed their trust in Home Lands\u2019 trusted track record of timely delivery. Further 400 units are ready to deliver within this year, reaffirming Home Lands\u2019 proven track record of completing projects on time and timely delivery of units.\n\nBuilding on the trust earned by Home Lands\u2019 commitment to reaching construction milestones ahead of time and delivering projects on time through financial discipline, innovation, best practices and advanced technology, Home Lands has delivered over 3,750 Resort Apartments and Villas, the highest number of units delivered by any developer in Sri Lanka while having sold over 5,000 units across 24 mega lifestyle development projects, the highest number of unit sales done by a developer in the country."
