    "md5": "e388597be9902c7055097ce832f37540",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 708,
    "chunk_text": "Clash erupts between MP Archchuna and Fisheries Minister\n\nColombo, July 16 (Daily Mirror) - A heated confrontation broke out between Jaffna District Independent MP Archchuna Ramanathan and Fisheries Minister Ramalingam Chandrasekar during the Kilinochchi District Coordination Committee meeting held today (16).\n\nThe dispute began as a verbal exchange between the two and quickly escalated, according to video footage of the incident.\n\nThe footage shows the confrontation intensifying when the Minister attempted to take files that were in MP Archchuna's possession.\n\nDuring the altercation, MP Archchuna is heard warning the Minister, saying, \"If you lay a hand on me, I'll lay a hand on you too... got it?\""
