    "description": "Driving economic growth is not the Central Bank\u2019s mandate: Whose mandate is it?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Driving-economic-growth-is-not-the-Central-Bank-s-mandate-Whose-mandate-is-it/4-794762",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
