    "description": "David Pieris Group to launch \u2018Social Empowerment Drive\u2019 in Batticaloa",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/David-Pieris-Group-to-launch-Social-Empowerment-Drive-in-Batticaloa/34-794804",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
