    "date_str": "2026-07-20",
    "description": "\u2018There are no private universities in Sri Lanka\u2019 \u2013 some considerations for higher education reform",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/there-are-no-private-universities-in-sri-lanka-some-considerations-for-higher-education-reform/",
