    "description": "Rice imports hit local production by 60%, says National Agrarians\u2019 Unity",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Rice-imports-hit-local-production-by-60-says-National-Agrarians-Unity/108-346186",
    "lang": "en",
