    "description": "At least 27 dead and 83 missing after passenger ferry capsizes off Guyana",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/At-least-27-dead-and-83-missing-after-passenger-ferry-capsizes-off-Guyana/108-346194",
    "lang": "en",
