    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Corporate Director Summit today\n\nThe Sri Lanka Institute of Directors (SLID) is hosting Sri Lanka Corporate Director Summit 2026 today, at Cinnamon Grand Colombo, under the theme \u2018Future-Ready Sri Lankan Directors: From Compliance to Sustainable Growth\u2019.\n\nKeynote address \u2018The New Reputation Risk Landscape \u2013 Social Media, Activism, Cyber Incidents and the Board\u2019s Oversight Responsibility\u2019 will be delivered by AP Moller Maersk Head of Public Policy and Regulatory Affairs India, Bangladesh and Sri Lanka and Maersk Bharat IFSCA (Pvt.) Ltd Board Director Vivek Sharma.\n\nThe conversation will continue with Nestl\u00e9 Lanka Chairman and Managing Director Manav Sahni during the panel discussion \u2018Trust is Capital \u2013 Why Reputation is a Boardroom Issue\u2019.\n\nLeadership, governance and long-term value creation will also take centre stage during an exclusive Fireside Chat featuring Unilever Sri Lanka Chairman and CEO and Unilever Sri Lanka, Myanmar, Cambodia and Laos Regional Head Ali Tariq, Galle Face Hotel Group Chairman Sanjeev Gardiner and Commercial Bank of Ceylon PLC Chairman Sharhan Muhseen.\n\nPanel discussion \u2018Talent and Culture \u2013 What Boards Can No Longer Ignore\u2019 will feature internationally accredited leadership coach and Corporate Druids (Pvt.) Ltd Managing Director Dr. Mihirini de Zoysa. Joining her will be Consultant Cardiologists Dr. Gotabhaya Ranasinghe."
  },
