    "description": "AmCham Sri Lanka represents member interests at Washington Doorknock 2026",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/AmCham-Sri-Lanka-represents-member-interests-at-Washington-Doorknock-2026/273-346250",
