    "chunk_text": "CA Sri Lanka and CSE conclude capacity-building workshops for SMEs\n\nThe Institute of Chartered Accountants of Sri Lanka (CA Sri Lanka) and the Colombo Stock Exchange (CSE) successfully concluded a series of capacity-building workshops aimed at empowering small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in Monaragala and Batticaloa.\n\nHeld on 16 and 18 July, the workshops equipped entrepreneurs with practical knowledge and tools to strengthen their financial standing, improve their creditworthiness, and enhance access to finance.\n\nThe initiative forms part of a broader, multifaceted programme launched by CA Sri Lanka and the CSE to support the development and growth of Sri Lanka\u2019s SME sector, which is widely recognised as a vital contributor to the national economy. The workshops addressed one of the key challenges faced by SMEs, namely limited access to finance, which continues to constrain the growth and expansion of many businesses."
