    "description": "Stop openly displaying alcohol for sale in supermarkets",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Stop-openly-displaying-alcohol-for-sale-in-supermarkets/172-346263",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
