    "description": "Despite \u2018Clean Sri Lanka\u2019, our cities are becoming dirtier and messier",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Despite-Clean-Sri-Lanka-our-cities-are-becoming-dirtier-and-messier/172-346265",
