    "description": "SC ruling on Seagull Property Developers:  A landmark judgment that reaffirms rule of law",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/SC-ruling-on-Seagull-Property-Developers-A-landmark-judgment-that-reaffirms-rule-of-law/4-794930",
