    "description": "Hayleys Aventura introduces Sri Lanka\u2019s first automated rotary parking system",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Hayleys-Aventura-introduces-Sri-Lanka-s-first-automated-rotary-parking-system/34-794935",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
