    "description": "Sri Lanka hosts landmark EY GDS Milestones event strengthening global leadership dialogue",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lanka-hosts-landmark-EY-GDS-Milestones-event-strengthening-global-leadership-dialogue/34-794971",
    "lang": "en",
