    "description": "Efficient public sector, accountable management accounting vital for sustainable development: PM",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Efficient-public-sector-accountable-management-accounting-vital-for-sustainable-development-PM/34-794972",
    "lang": "en",
