    "chunk_size_bytes": 476,
    "chunk_text": "Rs. 50mn worth illegal smartphones seized at Liberty Plaza\n\nColombo, July 22 (Daily Mirror) - More than 300 illegally imported high-end smartphones, including the latest Apple iPhone models, with an estimated value of around Rs. 50 million have been seized during a raid at a shop in Colombo\u2019s Liberty Plaza.\n\nPolice said the operation was carried out by the Walana Anti-Vice Squad.\n\nPolice also arrested a suspect in connection with the alleged illegal sale of the devices."
