    "chunk_size_bytes": 1592,
    "chunk_text": "Sampath Bank\u00a0secures\u00a0Sumathi Award for Digital Commercial\n\nFrom left: Anjali Goonetilake, Chief Manager \u2013 Marketing, Sampath Bank PLC; Manel Wanaguru - Actress; Dulantha Sumathipala, Director, NAPCO (Pvt) Ltd.; Hiroshan Waduge, Director, MUSE; Sudari Gunasekara, Managing Director, MUSE; Darshin Pathinayake, Chief Business Intelligence Officer; Sampath Bank PLC.\n\nSampath Bank PLC was recognised at the Sumathi Awards 2026, with the digital commercial created for its flagship CSR initiative, \u2018Wewata Jeewayak\u2019, earning Runner-Up honours in the Digital Commercial\n\nThe commercial highlighted the resilience of Sri Lanka\u2019s farming communities while drawing attention to the importance of preserving the nation\u2019s agricultural heritage and sustaining rural livelihoods for future generations.\n\nThe recognition reflects the impact of Wewata Jeewayak, a long-standing initiative through which Sampath Bank continues to support farming communities by restoring and revitalising village irrigation tanks across\n\nThrough a compelling narrative that brought these stories to life, the commercial reinforced the importance of safeguarding the resources that sustain Sri Lanka\u2019s agricultural sector and the communities that depend on them.\n\nThis achievement follows Sampath Bank\u2019s recognition at the Sumathi Awards 2025, where its Children\u2019s Day campaign, \u2018Mawath Dakinna\u2019, was also honoured under the Digital Commercial Award category, further demonstrating the Bank\u2019s commitment to creating meaningful and purpose-driven communications that resonate with audiences nationwide."
