    "chunk_text": "Hayleys Agriculture opens SL\u2019s 1st frozen concentrated coconut water manufacturing facility\n\nOfficial ribbon-cutting ceremony marking inauguration of Hayleys Nature Nest\u2014Sri Lanka\u2019s first frozen concentrated coconut water manufacturing facility\n\nInside state-of-the-art processing facility at Hayleys Nature Nest, featuring advanced pasteurisation and thermal processing equipment designed for producing high-quality frozen concentrated coconut water\n\nHayleys Agriculture Holdings Limited marks another milestone with the opening of Hayleys Nature Nest (Pvt.) Ltd, Sri Lanka\u2019s first of its kind frozen concentrated coconut water manufacturing facility.\n\nThis state-of-the-art facility represents another significant step in its journey to create greater value from Sri Lanka\u2019s rich agricultural resources.\n\nBy transforming the locally sourced coconut water into premium concentrated coconut water for export markets, Hayleys Nature Nest strengthens its commitment to innovation, sustainability and value-added agricultural exports.\n\nBeyond expanding its global footprint, this investment supports the local coconut growers and communities while contributing to increased export earnings and the long-term growth of Sri Lanka\u2019s agricultural sector.\n\n\u201cAs we celebrate this milestone, we remain committed to delivering sustainable, high-quality agricultural solutions that create value for our stakeholders and showcase the best of Sri Lanka to the world,\u201d a Hayleys Agriculture Holdings statement said."
  },
