    "chunk_text": "Lanka Realty sells On\u2019ally Holdings stake to Lee Hedges for Rs.2.26bn\n\nLanka Realty Investments PLC has divested its 50.886 percent stake in subsidiary On\u2019ally Holdings PLC to fellow group company Lee Hedges PLC, for a total consideration of Rs.2.26 billion, the company said in a stock exchange disclosure yesterday.\n\nThe transaction, approved by the company\u2019s board of directors on July 21, involves the sale of 47,325,368 ordinary shares held by Lanka Realty in On\u2019ally Holdings to Lee Hedges PLC, which is also a subsidiary of Lanka Realty Investments PLC.\n\nLanka Realty said the Related Party Transactions Review Committee had reviewed and recommended the divestment, which constitutes a non-recurrent related party transaction, under the Colombo Stock Exchange Listing Rules."
