    "md5": "0c48150afeb7e70037158c1d4ad4cd59",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1871,
    "chunk_text": "Hayleys Fabric PLC Wins Prestigious Global Climate Action Award, Reinforcing International Sustainability Leadership\n\nHayleys Fabric PLC earned this international recognition following a rigorous evaluation process, competing against more than 100 organizations from across multiple industries. The judging process assessed each organization\u2019s climate strategy, governance, emissions reduction performance, renewable energy transition, innovation, transparency, reporting and long-term commitment to sustainability\n\nHayleys Fabric PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s leading manufacturer of innovative weft knitted fabrics, has been internationally recognized with the Climate Action Award at the 3rd Edition Global ESG & Sustainability Conference and Awards 2026, organized by Corporate World Intelligence (CWI) in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. The award recognizes organizations that demonstrate measurable progress in climate action through carbon emissions reduction, renewable energy adoption, and sustainable manufacturing practices.\n\nEstablished as part of the Hayleys Group, Hayleys Fabric PLC with their fully owned subsidiary of South Asia Textiles Limited, is a trusted partner to leading global apparel brands and continues to strengthen its position as a sustainability driven textile manufacturer by integrating environmental stewardship, operational excellence, and long term value creation into its business strategy.\n\nThe Global ESG & Sustainability Conference and Awards is one of the region\u2019s premier sustainability platforms, bringing together leading organizations, policymakers, sustainability experts, and innovators from across the Asia-Pacific region. The awards celebrate organizations that are setting new benchmarks in Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) excellence and climate leadership through independently evaluated performance and measurable impact."
  },
