    "chunk_text": "Beyond infrastructure, we provide carefully selected books and digital equipment that broaden educational opportunities while supporting modern teaching methods. Our objective is always to ensure that every investment delivers sustainable value for both students and teachers.\n\nQ: How has \u2018Pahasara\u2019 influenced communities beyond the school itself?\n\nWhere possible, we engage local suppliers and businesses during refurbishment work, ensuring that the economic benefits remain within the community. Parents also participate in dedicated financial literacy sessions designed to strengthen their understanding of money management while enabling them to reinforce positive financial habits at home. When families become more financially aware, the benefits often extend beyond the classroom and contribute to stronger household financial decision-making.\n\nThe programme has also expanded beyond libraries. Scholarships have been awarded to outstanding Advanced Level students, while internships and continued educational engagements provide further opportunities for young people as they progress through their academic journey.\n\nUltimately, the success of \u2018Pahasara\u2019 lies in creating an ecosystem where education becomes a shared responsibility and a catalyst for broader community development.\n\nQ: How do you ensure these libraries continue to thrive long after they are opened?"
