    "chunk_size_bytes": 1748,
    "chunk_text": "Beyond infrastructure, Ceylinco Life has demonstrated a consistent focus on measuring and managing its environmental footprint. The company has undertaken comprehensive assessments of its greenhouse gas emissions, covering both direct and indirect impacts of its operations. These exercises provide a scientific basis for tracking progress and identifying opportunities for improvement. The company has set measurable targets for reducing its carbon footprint and has already achieved reductions through initiatives such as optimising energy use, reducing paper consumption, and improving fuel efficiency.\n\nAdditionally, the company has built and donated classrooms 89 schools to date and helps maintain them, contributing significantly to improved access to quality education for children across communities.\n\nEmployee wellbeing and development form another important dimension of the company\u2019s social agenda. Structured programmes for leadership development, digital upskilling, and talent management ensure that the workforce is equipped to meet evolving industry demands. The company has also placed emphasis on increasing the participation and empowerment of women within both its corporate and sales teams, reflecting a broader commitment to diversity and inclusion.\n\nGovernance underpins all these efforts. Ceylinco Life maintains a strong focus on transparency, ethics, and regulatory compliance, supported by robust risk management frameworks. ESG oversight is embedded within corporate governance structures, ensuring accountability at board and senior management levels. Sustainability performance is monitored through defined policies and reporting mechanisms, with increasing alignment to emerging global standards in ESG disclosure."
