    "chunk_text": "For organisations, the journey may begin with understanding their most significant environmental and social impacts, identifying the risks and opportunities that could affect their future, and strengthening the quality of the information they provide to stakeholders.\n\nFor professionals, it requires developing the expertise to support organisations through this transition.\n\nFor businesses of all sizes, including SMEs, sustainability is not simply a reporting requirement, but an opportunity to improve efficiency, strengthen resilience and remain competitive. Through its work on sustainability standards, governance, professional education, public-sector reporting and industry engagement, CA Sri Lanka is helping businesses, public institutions and professionals navigate this transition and contribute to a more sustainable and prosperous Sri Lanka."
