    "chunk_text": "Congo says more than 1,000 die of Ebola, confirmed cases rise to 2,536\n\nReuters - The number \u200bof confirmed Ebola \u200ccases in the Democratic \u200bRepublic of \u200bCongo has increased to 2,536, \u2060including \u200b1,033 deaths, government \u200bdata showed late on Wednesday.\n\nThe country's \u200bpublic \u200bhealth institute said in \u200cits \u2060latest report that 50 new cases \u200bwere \u200bdetected \u2060on Monday in \u200bthe eastern \u200bprovinces \u2060of Ituri and North \u2060Kivu."
