    "md5": "2fdaf22485ca3df553cc149124c66334",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1711,
    "chunk_text": "The scale and complexity of these activities require sustainability considerations to be integrated into how the Group plans its operations, delivers services and prepares for future growth. This commitment is guided by HELIOS, Advantis\u2019 ESG strategy, which is aligned with the Hayleys Lifecode and built around seven key pillars: Energy, Emissions, Biodiversity, Employee Engagement, Community Engagement, Safety and Governance. Through HELIOS, Advantis embeds sustainability into decision-making and long-term growth.\n\nFor Advantis, this approach balances environmental stewardship, social responsibility and strong governance across its operations.\n\nThe social dimension reflects the Group\u2019s commitment to its employees, customers and communities. Employee well-being, workplace safety, diversity and inclusion, skills development and community engagement remain central to building a responsible and future-ready organisation. Through Advantis DNA, the Group fosters an inclusive workplace culture by empowering its multi-generational workforce, encouraging participation and creating space for diverse perspectives.\n\nAdvantis also invests in future talent and the wider transportation and logistics ecosystem through Advantis All Around, which provides university students with mentorship, industry exposure and practical learning opportunities while creating greater awareness of career pathways within the sector.\n\nGovernance underpins the Group\u2019s approach to ethics, compliance and risk management. Effective oversight, transparent decision-making and responsible conduct enable Advantis to manage risk, maintain stakeholder confidence and build resilience across its operations and relationships."
