    "md5": "44f3697b78b37f0a626b0465a4a94165",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1837,
    "chunk_text": "Union Assurance introduces Platinum Circle\n\nEnables customers to protect what matters most while enjoying life\u2019s finest through curated experiences and added privileges\n\nUnion Assurance introduced Union Assurance Platinum Circle, an offering for eligible policyholders that redefines how they protect what matters most while, enjoying life\u2019s finest through curated experiences and added privileges.\n\nBuilt on this commitment, Union Assurance Platinum Circle brings together a purposefully designed standard of care, enhanced convenience and a heightened sense of appreciation, extending beyond the traditional Life Insurance experience.\n\nUnion Assurance policyholders who meet the eligibility criteria are automatically enabled to access the exclusive benefits of Union Assurance Platinum Circle. These include select lifestyle experiences, milestone recognitions, digital health services and various partner-led benefits, designed to celebrate important moments throughout a policyholder\u2019s life journey.\n\nFor added convenience, these privileges are also enabled via the Clicklife app, the industry\u2019s most comprehensive life insurance app, to ensure seamless customer management anytime, anywhere.\n\nUnion Assurance Director and Chief Executive Officer Senath Jayatilake stated, \u201cUnion Assurance Platinum Circle reflects how we continue to deepen our relationship with the policyholders over time. This rewarding platform represents the company\u2019s dedication to delivering exceptional services that goes beyond policies, reinforcing that the trust in Union Assurance is recognised and valued.\u201d\n\nUnion Assurance Chief Operating Officer Rumesh Modarage emphasised, \u201cUnion Assurance Platinum Circle demonstrates our commitment to combining thoughtful design with seamless execution, enhancing the life insurance experience.\u201d"
  },
