    "md5": "10c79dd9281a32afb01a63b91409c1ce",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1848,
    "chunk_text": "Seylan Bank partners with John Keells CG Auto to drive NEV ownership in Sri Lanka\n\nSeylan Bank PLC recently entered a strategic partnership with John Keells CG Auto (Pvt) Limited to introduce a dedicated leasing facility for customers purchasing New Energy Vehicles (NEVs) in Sri Lanka, strengthening the Bank\u2019s commitment to sustainable transport and green mobility solutions.\n\nThe partnership will offer tailored leasing facilities for premium NEV brands of BYD and DENZA, combining competitive financial solutions with a fast-tracked approval process and personalized customer support. Through this collaboration, customers will gain easier access to NEV ownership backed by attractive lease-to-own options and island-wide service support.\n\nUnder the agreement, Seylan Bank will provide leasing facilities with repayment periods extending up to seven years. Eligible customers can also receive lease approvals within 24 hours, enabling a smoother and more convenient purchasing experience.\n\nCommenting on the partnership, Asiri Abhayaratne, Assistant General Manager \u2013 Marketing & Sales said, \u201cAs a bank committed to supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s future in environmental sustainability, we are pleased to collaborate with John Keells CG Auto in expanding access to electric mobility solutions. Through this partnership, we aim to provide customers with flexible and convenient financing options that make NEV ownership more accessible while contributing to environmentally\u00a0responsible transportation.\u201d\n\nCharith Panditharatne, Chief Executive Officer of John Keells CG Auto said, \u201cWe are delighted to partner with Seylan Bank to further strengthen the NEV ecosystem in Sri Lanka. This collaboration enables customers to experience a seamless purchasing journey supported by attractive leasing solutions and enhanced customer convenience.\u201d"
