    "description": "Sri Lanka targets US$300mn in cinnamon exports as Alba price hits record Rs. 7,500",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Sri-Lanka-targets-US-300mn-in-cinnamon-exports-as-Alba-price-hits-record-Rs-7-500/215-346480",
