    "date_str": "2026-07-24",
    "description": "17 of 23 Negombo Prison deaths caused by gunshots",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/17-of-23-Negombo-Prison-deaths-caused-by-gunshots/56-795062",
